# Spacing

## About

Spacing controls the empty areas around or within components, such as margins, padding, and gaps between elements. Effective spacing improves readability, reduces visual clutter, and enhances usability. 

Spacing defines these visual aspects of a page.

* Proper alignment of components.
* Clear differentiation of grouped and unrelated elements.
* White space that directs user attention to key content or actions.

<design figma-url="https://www.figma.com/design/tLYtw0hYKA22PTU3TH2r7r/?node-id=6114:102372">

![Overview-spacing](https://zeroheight-uploads.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/3dbfc0c6648842bdef4454?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=AKIA3AVNYHQKYPFHNVW5%2F20260530%2Feu-west-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260530T145142Z&X-Amz-Expires=604800&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=5cae34ef1b31fcaf8f46333c2527dba70e6330bb8ee453ac860fc3bbd51af2a0)

**Overview-spacing**

