## Sizing Scale

The `sizing` values are used to create dimensions of an element, like using height and width-based properties. This is our defined sizing scale tied to styling hooks. Sizing in SLDS 2 uses the same values as SLDS, with multiples of 8 to align with the 8-point grid system.

