## Font weight

SLDS 2 uses only light, regular, semibold, and bold font weights. 

Font weights uses the property --slds-g-font-weight-3 (300) through --slds-g-font-weight-7 (700). Set font weights within your code using`--slds-g-font-weight-*` styling hooks.

<design figma-url="https://www.figma.com/design/tLYtw0hYKA22PTU3TH2r7r/?node-id=228:42129">

