</design>

| **Weight** | **Styling Hook** | **Value** | **Used For** |
| :--- | --- | --- | :--- |
| Light | --slds-g-font-weight-3 (300) | 300 | Display text |
| Regular | --slds-g-font-weight-4 (400) | 400 | Titles and body text |
| Semibold | --slds-g-font-weight-6 (600) | 600 | Buttons and smaller body titles |
| Bold | --slds-g-font-weight-7 (700) | 700 | Emphasize text where needed, use sparingly |

## Font color

On light backgrounds, you can apply these colors to text.

* --slds-g-color-on-surface-1 (#5C5C5C) (lightest text)
* --slds-g-color-on-surface-2 (#2E2E2E)(darker text)
* --slds-g-color-on-surface-3 (#03234D) (titles)

On dark backgrounds, you can apply `on-surface-inverse`.

