**Utility-Utility**

<notes>

Utility icons-email, camera, palette, page, print, connected apps, chart, color swatch

</notes>

</design>

Utility icons appear in both mobile and desktop environments-including in feeds, global headers, navigation, docked composers, button groups, alerts, and toasts.

