## Action Icons

<shortcut_tiles>
<shortcut_tile url="https://www.lightningdesignsystem.com/2e1ef8501/v/0/p/83309d-icons/b/586464">
![Browse Icons](https://zeroheight-user-uploads.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/images/u6eikR0AX1gbjOPqf_ZlOg.jpg?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=AKIA3AVNYHQKYPFHNVW5%2F20260530%2Feu-west-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260530T145223Z&X-Amz-Expires=604800&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Signature=68d2c6db3d27f5d295bdf9386b507cdb8e3cea0d8a6bfa596fc0ca8537a7abb0)

